  "editionId": 16,
  "counts": {
    "heading": 34,
    "paragraph": 91,
    "unknown": 0
  },
  "sourceEditorialNotes": 33,
  "existingExplanationTables": [],
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "paragraphId": 129631,
      "seq": 1,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 19,
      "sourceSha256": "6236331d3a2920612300b4c330037a585774efdb0f323e21b780fc5a3c5e48f6",
      "head": "起著雍攝提格，盡玄黓困敦，凡三十五年。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189176,
      "seq": 2,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 3,
      "sourceSha256": "a41f490017ca8b3cbfcffefcf8afda6d0d6ed560f2f32621af10233c22ad6553",
      "head": "威烈王",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189177,
      "seq": 3,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 19,
      "sourceSha256": "6704bf64fe0e6db19d3621b3347b731be95e492b3ebe30e5d0f7678c80d9856b",
      "head": "威烈王二十三年（戊寅，西元前四〇三年）",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129632,
      "seq": 4,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 23,
      "sourceSha256": "59cb45ce67f112ac5d8407de4c7eb6a095d271d5fdd62aee4ebc94e50f67d2e1",
      "head": "〔九鼎震〕，初命晉大夫魏斯、趙籍、韓虔為諸侯。",
      "editorialNotes": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129633,
      "seq": 5,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 60,
      "sourceSha256": "d8b08e700d41d7063b322a1e179206ee15ac3ee9052ed02b968c8bff0e9d3927",
      "head": "臣光曰：臣聞天子之職莫大於禮，禮莫大於分，分莫大於名。何謂禮？紀綱是也；何謂分？君臣是也；何謂名？公、侯、卿、",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129634,
      "seq": 6,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 160,
      "sourceSha256": "14c07180ab2f68d88bcdd5715bc69f9f9f3c1173b7eb69094bdafa99734327dc",
      "head": "夫以四海之廣，兆民之眾，受制於一人，雖有絕倫之力，高世之智，莫敢不奔走而服役者，豈非以禮為之〔紀〕綱(紀)哉！",
      "editorialNotes": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129635,
      "seq": 7,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 201,
      "sourceSha256": "0a9330cb71926903888eeaa0e4060690c52cdfaf3577cfc114db4231dcefed60",
      "head": "文王序《易》，以乾坤為首。孔子繫之曰：「天尊地卑，乾坤定矣，卑高以陳，貴賤位矣。」言君臣之位，猶天地之不可易也",
      "editorialNotes": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129636,
      "seq": 8,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 307,
      "sourceSha256": "19267c8b96a5652736b55f9a4b3cc5f3b85eeb0c2b32c16685f1a113470cd3c4",
      "head": "夫禮，辨貴賤，序親疏，裁群物，制庶事。非名不著，非器不形。名以命之，器以別之，然後上下粲然有倫，此禮之大經也。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129637,
      "seq": 9,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 500,
      "sourceSha256": "50356493f319ebf9801f4e23a0af42504e162f809fe784c5ca0b8c1110b65984",
      "head": "嗚呼！幽、厲失德，周道日衰，綱紀散壞，下陵上替，諸侯專征，大夫擅政。禮之大體，什喪七八矣。然文、武之祀猶綿綿相",
      "editorialNotes": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129638,
      "seq": 10,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 53,
      "sourceSha256": "e5d3cb41f10858d9c209277f30b92eaacb8cdd8b53ea420c787c71021c1b7692",
      "head": "嗚呼！君臣之禮既壞矣，則天下以智力相雄長，遂使聖賢之後為諸侯者，社稷無不泯絕，生民之害糜滅幾盡，豈不哀哉！",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129639,
      "seq": 11,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 478,
      "sourceSha256": "3ae555f0071a60b2f12ef1d12f743c3013f8df9522c837ffae1deba5fde6c3a2",
      "head": "初，智宣子將以瑤為後。智果曰：「不如宵也。瑤之賢於人者五，其不逮者一也。美鬢長大則賢，射御足力則賢，伎藝畢給則",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129640,
      "seq": 12,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 440,
      "sourceSha256": "e4da214d323747385afedfd70267c61caf23936205040debf1b54e3e305ef524",
      "head": "智伯請地於韓康子，康子欲弗與。段規曰：「智伯好利而愎，不與，將伐我；不如與之。彼狃於得地，必請於他人；他人不與",
      "editorialNotes": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129641,
      "seq": 13,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 342,
      "sourceSha256": "5f0bbcb1ee17728bc253d6fddec4cb5176095bf1994c88fc74ab3c775523b1be",
      "head": "三家以國人圍而灌之，城不浸者三版。沈竈產鼃，民無叛意。智伯行水，魏桓子御，韓康子驂乘。智伯曰：「吾乃今知水可以",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129642,
      "seq": 14,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 182,
      "sourceSha256": "47323976f91be06616dc686e73b124d5ad8578014a24fa2ae81d6a36dc8cd233",
      "head": "趙襄子使張孟談潛出見二子，曰：「臣聞脣亡則齒寒。今智伯帥韓、魏而攻趙，趙亡則韓、魏為之次矣。」二子曰：「我心知",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129643,
      "seq": 15,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 413,
      "sourceSha256": "6c98952841bf206fb2672384ed29a7855b0a136c891179724ca40ebf04c6c836",
      "head": "臣光曰：智伯之亡也，才勝德也。夫才與德異，而世俗莫之能辨，通謂之賢，此其所以失人也。夫聰察強毅之謂才，正直中和",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129644,
      "seq": 16,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 431,
      "sourceSha256": "4f537bd228b23d4d680cafa0a2f51c63cc4ca849dedb1bb2e217c0c384942694",
      "head": "三家分智氏之田。趙襄子漆智伯之頭，以為飲器。智伯之臣豫讓欲為之報仇，乃詐為刑人，挾匕首，入襄子宮中塗廁。襄子如",
      "editorialNotes": 4
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129645,
      "seq": 17,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 997,
      "sourceSha256": "4cd30d34de1235e38f9d7a43a15768e43735d4aa85022fa44b70bb1d76d4dc36",
      "head": "魏文侯以卜子夏、田子方為師，每過段干木之廬必式。四方賢士多歸之。文侯與群臣飲酒，樂，而天雨，命駕將適野。左右曰",
      "editorialNotes": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129646,
      "seq": 18,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 305,
      "sourceSha256": "e7aa7e3a1698b21a39289398cabfe256a0a42dbb59371f353eb72dc652bc7f52",
      "head": "吳起者，衛人，仕於魯。齊人伐魯，魯人欲以為將，起取齊女為妻，魯人疑之，起殺妻以求將，大破齊師。或譖之魯侯曰：「",
      "editorialNotes": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129647,
      "seq": 19,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 10,
      "sourceSha256": "3bc55903313b78f903db7edfec65ebabdc1ab24dffe947318d20675812ebea8b",
      "head": "燕湣公薨，子僖公立。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189178,
      "seq": 20,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 19,
      "sourceSha256": "38d1ee254892966b89ca3fe04e998848611341ee345882252321adb6c556d4ae",
      "head": "威烈王二十四年（己卯，西元前四〇二年）",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129648,
      "seq": 21,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 9,
      "sourceSha256": "4133f1c8d855345c0a1fe3b2d9394d5a29694d87fd7306424ac0f78c4b7054a7",
      "head": "王崩，子安王驕立。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129649,
      "seq": 22,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 20,
      "sourceSha256": "12caa75d43f5bd138765e27eaf33e7b9e1da91009ba331124cf4385e173f3c48",
      "head": "盜殺楚聲王，國人立其子〔疑，是為〕悼王。",
      "editorialNotes": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189179,
      "seq": 23,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 2,
      "sourceSha256": "1bc55666b935a9b57bd20cfe0fa030126183e3cd1cd854c484c1944ba114fa0d",
      "head": "安王",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189180,
      "seq": 24,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 16,
      "sourceSha256": "ccda5a059dbcc0c449ef8ed5de9d1a2d58ab7d56d5b4d2c89f8579e9c9a54693",
      "head": "安王元年（庚辰，西元前四〇一年）",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129650,
      "seq": 25,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 13,
      "sourceSha256": "ef6352fe9c87e1f43b091af469f39e31fdbff159be9cad9f823e7845bac114a9",
      "head": "秦伐魏，至陽〔狐〕(孤)。",
      "editorialNotes": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189181,
      "seq": 26,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 16,
      "sourceSha256": "055543ee2df7e3c5423111dcdcab4b3cc55c9e34e7f77f0ba50585871eaa5f55",
      "head": "安王二年（辛巳，西元前四〇〇年）",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129651,
      "seq": 27,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 17,
      "sourceSha256": "f8bb18d4c6df45b4bb2f0df1de92daffd5008aa60e6a13d900f3ad83ea3665e6",
      "head": "魏、韓、趙伐楚，至〔乘〕(桑)丘。",
      "editorialNotes": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129652,
      "seq": 28,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 6,
      "sourceSha256": "febbaabcd16f2571a56744ba2343503d184c520e34076ea88beccfb188096d71",
      "head": "鄭圍韓陽翟。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129653,
      "seq": 29,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 11,
      "sourceSha256": "aa9968515bbba57cd29148d405794742643c635e7ae7fa05b111111f7f39dfe4",
      "head": "韓景侯薨，子烈侯取立。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129654,
      "seq": 30,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 13,
      "sourceSha256": "4efd3ebacfc0d44902da99999fd211f41a3b17a573f367b60740a19364689a1f",
      "head": "趙烈侯薨，國人立其弟武侯。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129655,
      "seq": 31,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 10,
      "sourceSha256": "944e0fd97802d9b0e02425864a11f66e366b07929b4d655c82d733baeb46640e",
      "head": "秦簡公薨，子惠公立。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189182,
      "seq": 32,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 16,
      "sourceSha256": "3c9f15ff2113113709a20a59e396e80a172f1aa73bb7d93ccb82d0efd69bcadc",
      "head": "安王三年（壬午，西元前三九九年）",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129656,
      "seq": 33,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 6,
      "sourceSha256": "c40ace8025b7ad71cb3c3177d1d2b3b90b2bd89e8f864fc9921fb5db28870601",
      "head": "王子定奔晉。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129657,
      "seq": 34,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 7,
      "sourceSha256": "1f286365bf2184cb85ee0a9fcedf3d35ec25f753e22982b2f819c653d60806bf",
      "head": "虢山崩，壅河。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189183,
      "seq": 35,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 16,
      "sourceSha256": "2fea7eabcbf2c3a8ed1c718a7fcbf0db3f6a4beb6dbf6710a9d6bb706c529cb9",
      "head": "安王四年（癸未，西元前三九八年）",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129658,
      "seq": 36,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 19,
      "sourceSha256": "1d548239ca43c6785d3d44b89b8007865a6c33b2c578ed8f818da329c603bc2d",
      "head": "楚〔敗鄭師〕，圍鄭。鄭人殺其相駟子陽。",
      "editorialNotes": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189184,
      "seq": 37,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 16,
      "sourceSha256": "6baa84ab5cfb2aa3d6b1929cdc8b85650e10b251dd83bd8b718ccf0e92b8d750",
      "head": "安王五年（甲申，西元前三九七年）",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129659,
      "seq": 38,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 5,
      "sourceSha256": "fc9ef254d719cbd9b039b79ed72657e96d15ca81e1972c6c69b6565e000dd67f",
      "head": "日有食之。",
      "editorialNotes": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129660,
      "seq": 39,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 200,
      "sourceSha256": "814db51a0b93db1def2b8ebc0ff761cfe7db973501faa559c08edab4006cdee7",
      "head": "〔春〕，三月，盜殺韓相俠累。俠累與濮陽嚴仲子有惡。仲子聞軹人聶政之勇，以黃金百鎰為政母壽，欲因以報仇。政不受，",
      "editorialNotes": 2
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189185,
      "seq": 40,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 16,
      "sourceSha256": "3e777417688e60de7ad84725c13c15ea1731a312561bcb8f7780f37843750e5a",
      "head": "安王六年（乙酉，西元前三九六年）",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129661,
      "seq": 41,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 21,
      "sourceSha256": "1a3f52c5ce4669ff24504ba4073c90adb8ad3e5f0c2461618999e9b5ff127b12",
      "head": "鄭駟子陽之黨弒繻公，而立其弟乙，是為康公。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189186,
      "seq": 42,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 16,
      "sourceSha256": "8f0fe7e9a0821052941282c51031acacc11a7687f5dece0177a4d2c2634c80b1",
      "head": "安王八年（丁亥，西元前三九四年）",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129662,
      "seq": 43,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 13,
      "sourceSha256": "4a1453f1353a21309fac828d625736515ffb2030f61ada0ad1929d730fdbaf6b",
      "head": "齊伐魯，取最。〔韓救魯〕。",
      "editorialNotes": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129663,
      "seq": 44,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 9,
      "sourceSha256": "9cca25affd44e5ad0d2453e7e50be4e41c8d3079d04d6ccf3d052c31dbc4deab",
      "head": "鄭負黍叛，復歸韓。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189187,
      "seq": 45,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 16,
      "sourceSha256": "03769f54c10c8d727fdd1fdcc1391408cacbf1755c8b0c3348e6baab6a5639c4",
      "head": "安王九年（戊子，西元前三九三年）",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129664,
      "seq": 46,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 4,
      "sourceSha256": "c8a5d324a09f154c42f1efa8ca2f61380442ff7ebeb643269b932e8fc891b39a",
      "head": "魏伐鄭。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129665,
      "seq": 47,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 11,
      "sourceSha256": "d394a397d7c2f4ea507b6cf4ea8f69e88d7afe7b6d69b6b68619e733c50f6e6b",
      "head": "晉烈公薨，子孝公傾立。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189188,
      "seq": 48,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 17,
      "sourceSha256": "44b43e70cc7e73b916a46d452f55db2c9b7d20b027b98a87b260866f987a2f32",
      "head": "安王十一年（庚寅，西元前三九一年）",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129666,
      "seq": 49,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 10,
      "sourceSha256": "41fb44fc66789e4c7395081e97752adeafb26d8147fc5bbea5e3b9ac9df94b03",
      "head": "秦伐韓宜陽，取六邑。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129667,
      "seq": 50,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 50,
      "sourceSha256": "1aa65f21f07f898be0a808f005968946df17d80d3d9460a8424a3709a825bd2f",
      "head": "初，田〔恆〕(常)生襄子盤，盤生莊子白，白生太公和。是歲，田和遷齊康公於海上，使食一城，以奉其先祀。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189189,
      "seq": 51,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 17,
      "sourceSha256": "7405d63f5b3301109d598889b27ca6b287bee67e7daaf622e89589713881878c",
      "head": "安王十二年（辛卯，西元前三九〇年）",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129668,
      "seq": 52,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 8,
      "sourceSha256": "9a80320553f72dae5f75626df04a46efec464be8c92410ace1a2309465fe48e0",
      "head": "秦、晉戰於武城。",
      "editorialNotes": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129669,
      "seq": 53,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 13,
      "sourceSha256": "2bddcc73e46ef91119ac83ee065bce594beaa3fb3cd5f97760ce736b00644fc8",
      "head": "齊伐魏，取襄〔陵〕(陽)。",
      "editorialNotes": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129670,
      "seq": 54,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 8,
      "sourceSha256": "b30074aec7c339e867cd0826681c706625cf8b0eb5d2d6c02e04087acb871fa2",
      "head": "魯敗齊師于平陸。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189190,
      "seq": 55,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 17,
      "sourceSha256": "3fac0085791b2657e7488eaa1852ddda90dd091622fed7e1ff1d6ec55147fde9",
      "head": "安王十三年（壬辰，西元前三八九年）",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129671,
      "seq": 56,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 8,
      "sourceSha256": "09471f50cfc20ba33fc0fff6b2b98a034a78f671cdae24fd53294300e2ea2e2d",
      "head": "秦侵〔魏陰〕晉。",
      "editorialNotes": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129672,
      "seq": 57,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 38,
      "sourceSha256": "a449547455bf4c770ecdbda5cea7c36a18e7880cc1edbf9212f6b67dd22e43f8",
      "head": "齊田和會魏文侯、楚人、衛人于濁澤，求為諸侯。魏文侯為之請於王及諸侯，王許之。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189191,
      "seq": 58,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 17,
      "sourceSha256": "89c0b77b805fe5f3a7b4031e98b1ca673e02c1c3394a9c6fd35d0690572e1b78",
      "head": "安王十五年（甲午，西元前三八七年）",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129673,
      "seq": 59,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 8,
      "sourceSha256": "870221f1dd92e344ca5eddfb748979e7826906157db477ef215b92fff68c06f9",
      "head": "秦伐蜀，取南鄭。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129674,
      "seq": 60,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 15,
      "sourceSha256": "1d285ed045de93c9261556663de560d6d4bbad375585147358b7707afc0adfb4",
      "head": "魏文侯薨，太子擊立，是為武侯。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129675,
      "seq": 61,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 173,
      "sourceSha256": "f3db86ce2a7800893fc9cfe257693d10f0c0644931fe49ffadd42216312aa738",
      "head": "武侯浮西河而下，中流顧謂吳起曰：「美哉山河之固，此魏國之寶也！」對曰：「在德不在險。昔三苗氏，左洞庭，右彭蠡，",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129676,
      "seq": 62,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 493,
      "sourceSha256": "c5fd07562375445f7dce5ff058652ff55c9f8d81ce3b23a46e9c86e466826c78",
      "head": "魏置相，相田文。吳起不悅，謂田文曰：「請與子論功，可乎？」田文曰：「可。」起曰：「將三軍，使士卒樂死，敵國不敢",
      "editorialNotes": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129677,
      "seq": 63,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 10,
      "sourceSha256": "6ad74c4fd04730cfee451cbc5e6212007ed8f2d5932cc90cf3528e999c80c1e5",
      "head": "秦惠公薨，子出公立。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129678,
      "seq": 64,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 21,
      "sourceSha256": "da38af7dfa95e9d26e900328ee9dc9a6c44be8df409bb2c38f246ea09891c79a",
      "head": "趙武侯薨，國人復立烈侯之太子章，是為敬侯。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129679,
      "seq": 65,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 10,
      "sourceSha256": "11137c4e370db3f774bd1143d1e9da9715b571ab8b7d1faff84c22a24f1f3cba",
      "head": "韓烈侯薨，子文侯立。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189192,
      "seq": 66,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 17,
      "sourceSha256": "f522c18ec5aa853f6c2298605c82d913f9027f1d9000ac2ba82cdcd5d85cddc4",
      "head": "安王十六年（乙未，西元前三八六年）",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129680,
      "seq": 67,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 11,
      "sourceSha256": "42c345f06934f60cd26afbe637c25fd41e4740fea42d6254b710843a75801b93",
      "head": "初命齊大夫田和為諸侯。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129681,
      "seq": 68,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 20,
      "sourceSha256": "49edb2d163a49dde3a912dcb9a3e8b03923519d36c039683e63314b1ee5a1b2c",
      "head": "趙公子朝作亂，出奔魏，與魏襲邯鄲，不克。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189193,
      "seq": 69,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 17,
      "sourceSha256": "63565de934008e3301c31f3f112d3530104c086c79d150d6fff3143d8d44ec33",
      "head": "安王十七年（丙申，西元前三八五年）",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129682,
      "seq": 70,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 31,
      "sourceSha256": "5f9e8d3ad63b63571f97613fc7f702ce3334714a6b46283de9abb8752fec695c",
      "head": "秦庶長改〔迎〕(逆)獻公于河西而立之；殺出子及其母，沉之淵旁。",
      "editorialNotes": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129683,
      "seq": 71,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 4,
      "sourceSha256": "e5576d16bcf84867c29fcba804fb017d942053122873e32ac6068bc9a9fea423",
      "head": "齊伐魯。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129684,
      "seq": 72,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 28,
      "sourceSha256": "7d9fe46e08d09ab8b4151d8c0616e83f782affb541df029068e59bee1c2e5c17",
      "head": "韓伐鄭，取陽城；伐宋，執宋〔悼〕公，〔國人立子休公田〕。",
      "editorialNotes": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129685,
      "seq": 73,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 11,
      "sourceSha256": "e9d3b367fb82f69ab3c9d799940bdf8abbecc1d2558226f639860be6645b6202",
      "head": "齊太公薨，子桓公午立。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189194,
      "seq": 74,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 17,
      "sourceSha256": "427a62da69468d525f70d7b7ca4187035d35e7bf0576ef1941df15a3fface421",
      "head": "安王十九年（戊戌，西元前三八三年）",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129686,
      "seq": 75,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 8,
      "sourceSha256": "5f3c51da95759380a5b7bbfb4a9b3796deab20080355e96db9099632f57cd9e8",
      "head": "魏敗趙師於兔臺。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129687,
      "seq": 76,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 13,
      "sourceSha256": "8d08b98f737b4b84857dae6534e05cc5541eaaa0ab42f7fe90fc0c746de31f52",
      "head": "〔魯穆公薨，子共公奮立〕。",
      "editorialNotes": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189195,
      "seq": 77,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 17,
      "sourceSha256": "9786398de294463538a4b268cf98a2d49d2e42c4bd16bd9d70d7c50421b69316",
      "head": "安王二十年（己亥，西元前三八二年）",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129688,
      "seq": 78,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 7,
      "sourceSha256": "1dcfc19247e13dfe55b56c5df648c4dfc26f968ecfdae65d3b55038452598f2e",
      "head": "日有食之，既。",
      "editorialNotes": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189196,
      "seq": 79,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 18,
      "sourceSha256": "d6fc1bacd5afe8f7e7c0de2197fc74e16b66de316a226fab02b40fbec9f36dfa",
      "head": "安王二十一年（庚子，西元前三八一年）",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129689,
      "seq": 80,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 73,
      "sourceSha256": "f45f54e8a152f5b50dac424f4bf26187f150c19ebe56d5a3f2d4ffa310c2a6af",
      "head": "楚悼王薨，貴戚大臣作亂，攻吳起，起走之王尸而伏之。擊起之徒因射刺起，並中王尸。既葬，〔太子〕肅王〔臧〕即位。使",
      "editorialNotes": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189197,
      "seq": 81,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 18,
      "sourceSha256": "cb85777f54990da0f502bf2df19ebd74e80b04db93ba5703dfa1d9f57dcc3ebb",
      "head": "安王二十二年（辛丑，西元前三八〇年）",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129690,
      "seq": 82,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 20,
      "sourceSha256": "cb8b4bd9a66cee23858f22d08531686d0d68483de1ca736e5f652c781b7f1902",
      "head": "齊伐燕，取桑丘。魏、韓、趙伐齊，至桑丘。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189198,
      "seq": 83,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 18,
      "sourceSha256": "d142fc6468543c48bbdd934b4623ca7ce226c4f88be65cf9b286a25a09eeb7fc",
      "head": "安王二十三年（壬寅，西元前三七九年）",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129691,
      "seq": 84,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 7,
      "sourceSha256": "1eacaf83fac2b3cc87df8e3790c08d32ddd83c457eb3a85e2534c0f5b61dc3c5",
      "head": "趙襲衛，不克。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129692,
      "seq": 85,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 17,
      "sourceSha256": "852f9fdca4f403a0597c19a5019ba3d33a67e2fc0276af19557b533bdd6432c1",
      "head": "齊康公薨，無子，田氏遂並齊而有之。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189199,
      "seq": 86,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 18,
      "sourceSha256": "d224e05cc2c150981360338d1fcabed81dc105b030fbaf652d0dfc4d01706e91",
      "head": "安王二十四年（癸卯，西元前三七八年）",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129693,
      "seq": 87,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 7,
      "sourceSha256": "7877eb92e89fb4858681a58a1920321af8afcbbda590851fc988f5445c88874e",
      "head": "狄敗魏師于澮。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129694,
      "seq": 88,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 12,
      "sourceSha256": "ce2409daacb496f5e72c0e4c4cdf4182e403d6a8ef5b1e0a3c1d6fbeeb848084",
      "head": "魏、韓、趙伐齊，至靈丘。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129695,
      "seq": 89,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 12,
      "sourceSha256": "8abcfc25304a5a134b6f5b30b5831bd71c8ec21c7bf4a6023b777491be2edc2a",
      "head": "晉孝公薨，子靖公俱酒立。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189200,
      "seq": 90,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 18,
      "sourceSha256": "eb7d49aed27b1d98362bad1546f7f9114b52afd31f82eba981eeeaea46b76936",
      "head": "安王二十五年（甲辰，西元前三七七年）",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129696,
      "seq": 91,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 8,
      "sourceSha256": "a766998ead47b8c1f0f8eafb69a08facc0d066e871cbd80d557fea453454c065",
      "head": "蜀伐楚，取茲方。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129697,
      "seq": 92,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 442,
      "sourceSha256": "85970c5e41cfaf846c61ee1818c6e4ce585660d39d945b6fd936a827f42a5342",
      "head": "子思言苟變於衛侯曰：「其材可將五百乘。」公曰：「吾知其可將。然變也嘗為吏，賦於民而食人二雞子，故弗用也。」子思",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129698,
      "seq": 93,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 10,
      "sourceSha256": "5fc2299302e090f0fbcd27d87a2a2d12057e1c782cf534882ac86891acd0402c",
      "head": "韓文侯薨，子哀侯立。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189201,
      "seq": 94,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 18,
      "sourceSha256": "a76f840dfc4e09f4971fc230d3bc0495ad680dbb976ad2372ba9b73802e77336",
      "head": "安王二十六年（乙巳，西元前三七六年）",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129699,
      "seq": 95,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 9,
      "sourceSha256": "7569af600e5042d8a78a728dc841178c18ffffe5656359d74c07ae78925b1cbe",
      "head": "王崩，子烈王喜立。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129700,
      "seq": 96,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 18,
      "sourceSha256": "53f086512e42083b26a933c406eeebf2c3077f1ab478b4b1a7ebdc709866cfda",
      "head": "魏、韓、趙共廢晉靖公為家人而分其地。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189202,
      "seq": 97,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 2,
      "sourceSha256": "bee5e68545af4062848d8afccd2b669414c34a1103330b266b34528be2dcc00e",
      "head": "烈王",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189203,
      "seq": 98,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 16,
      "sourceSha256": "f8037308f78cf6b4ab6937cfe1dc80bad86cd664c0a04b8982141afcd18caf50",
      "head": "烈王元年（丙午，西元前三七五年）",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129701,
      "seq": 99,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 5,
      "sourceSha256": "fc9ef254d719cbd9b039b79ed72657e96d15ca81e1972c6c69b6565e000dd67f",
      "head": "日有食之。",
      "editorialNotes": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129702,
      "seq": 100,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 9,
      "sourceSha256": "07ce0e21d1006420dec9c8b302ab3bc588f9ad568b90f41d71c633fe97188ce9",
      "head": "韓滅鄭，因徒都之。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129703,
      "seq": 101,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 11,
      "sourceSha256": "77c07dab4bb516e7f0bdc6c1ad3a02077529ac28634f97aae8d0d5d98dfca9c5",
      "head": "趙敬侯薨，子成侯種立。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189204,
      "seq": 102,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 16,
      "sourceSha256": "53f7b887d90fac7b82ae3b82467aeb1ccdf54de04eb4978459f433499c8ea3e2",
      "head": "烈王二年（丁未，西元前三七四年）",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129704,
      "seq": 103,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 70,
      "sourceSha256": "664e7acf85ccf3aaee275d5736003fa5b19a8d350ea7c5db54a24b73e747bb9a",
      "head": "〔韓嚴遂弒哀侯，國人立其子懿侯若山。初，哀侯以韓廆為相而愛嚴遂，二人甚相害也。嚴遂令人刺韓廆於朝，廆走哀侯，哀",
      "editorialNotes": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189205,
      "seq": 104,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 16,
      "sourceSha256": "1ac25646d6ed2bdda9e1f99d78f1ea91fd45fa3eaeb1f258fe53657a6855ec84",
      "head": "烈王三年（戊申，西元前三七三年）",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129705,
      "seq": 105,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 8,
      "sourceSha256": "3f3eda5f2dc6cccaaa6472c46497ff1ee5f2e58c44032eab558ed79815c4e7a6",
      "head": "燕敗齊師於林狐。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129706,
      "seq": 106,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 8,
      "sourceSha256": "dc179738df74767d93c661722db76ee9e8c7bf80fcc5a4635acffd64231c85b9",
      "head": "魯伐齊，入陽關。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129707,
      "seq": 107,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 8,
      "sourceSha256": "e5928566ade26a728a8befbadd7b3a99312c3bb314b0e9ba101424eb86e09849",
      "head": "魏伐齊，至博陵。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129708,
      "seq": 108,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 10,
      "sourceSha256": "783cc164daf7da11f4267d367a6df04c72fe8b9e6e57b25b213f5f6664c29e60",
      "head": "燕僖侯薨，子桓侯立。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129709,
      "seq": 109,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 11,
      "sourceSha256": "1c686a86ef4569903c1c8d9879466c1d6b9aea17f1146e69aee2526f686fbcfa",
      "head": "衛慎侯薨，子聲侯訓立。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189206,
      "seq": 110,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 16,
      "sourceSha256": "0542f382df9b0f645114f2fa7373ab4249f287f2a134985f1be2c68c16ffc6b1",
      "head": "烈王四年（己酉，西元前三七二年）",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129710,
      "seq": 111,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 11,
      "sourceSha256": "204a9a1c1e2d2044591a555475edd621a9657d7fa7239488060a8c2510a90c4f",
      "head": "趙伐衛，取都鄙七十三。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129711,
      "seq": 112,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 8,
      "sourceSha256": "5f55252d6220d6658826809f31c4c058a0cf1e4cab1ccfe02795228ae7d991df",
      "head": "魏敗趙師于北藺。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189207,
      "seq": 113,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 16,
      "sourceSha256": "456d7fb4af4d3121cc0f05244640a39bd7926dd1b357d636fa1b30d42855072b",
      "head": "烈王五年（庚戌，西元前三七一年）",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129712,
      "seq": 114,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 8,
      "sourceSha256": "173a8f816f0c03464bea447d16542207a64e92ab32eaf6e88d529ee9dbaecfb2",
      "head": "魏伐楚，取魯陽。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189208,
      "seq": 115,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 16,
      "sourceSha256": "8b88656412e3dbbe78b635ce0c917baa7bbb1d05b6051b9c28ee7bbd49f3166f",
      "head": "烈王六年（辛亥，西元前三七〇年）",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129713,
      "seq": 116,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 45,
      "sourceSha256": "a27af783168a6fddee30e08b541741d0bfc8064f4406859e310a15e742711a3b",
      "head": "齊〔桓公〕(威王)來朝。是時周室微弱，諸侯莫朝，而齊獨朝之，天下以此益賢〔桓公〕(威王)。",
      "editorialNotes": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129714,
      "seq": 117,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 7,
      "sourceSha256": "8d8a31ce22a60a1441ff6b505aae50f400ae4002e483a1265f740a1f6390d3d9",
      "head": "趙伐齊，至鄄。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129715,
      "seq": 118,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 7,
      "sourceSha256": "3ec0faac379ff3255c822223ee13841ce8f6c527d4ef4de71dfa3ea85365a014",
      "head": "魏敗趙師于懷。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129716,
      "seq": 119,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 19,
      "sourceSha256": "c26a73d77ed0da4b452d34c98f92bd6fdb02878afe1f382978e5c39f5faf87bd",
      "head": "楚肅王薨，無子，立其弟良夫，是為宣王。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129717,
      "seq": 120,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 25,
      "sourceSha256": "646492229945e29cbcb7010c4e9c016f13ffa05557221fddbc26355684742e3f",
      "head": "〔魏武侯薨，不立太子，子罃與公中緩爭立，國內亂〕。",
      "editorialNotes": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 189209,
      "seq": 121,
      "kind": "heading",
      "chars": 16,
      "sourceSha256": "337b9f7c0695f71e286801f072c60cf07f764851be6ae9f737321dceddc1e32a",
      "head": "烈王七年（壬子，西元前三六九年）",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129718,
      "seq": 122,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 5,
      "sourceSha256": "fc9ef254d719cbd9b039b79ed72657e96d15ca81e1972c6c69b6565e000dd67f",
      "head": "日有食之。",
      "editorialNotes": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129719,
      "seq": 123,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 12,
      "sourceSha256": "69e4d07edb5da514baa39f16a4f1a91ee39c57b02d9d133c8bbf379c89109526",
      "head": "王崩，弟扁立，是為顯王。",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129720,
      "seq": 124,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 164,
      "sourceSha256": "8aa9e3478a794545c9099ceb2a95842c64fe1a2131065b13585605c7486d0f02",
      "head": "魏大夫王錯出奔韓。公孫頎謂韓懿侯曰：「魏亂，可取也。」懿侯乃與趙成侯合兵伐魏，戰于濁澤，大破之，遂圍魏。成侯曰",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": 129721,
      "seq": 125,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "chars": 58,
      "sourceSha256": "fa681853b18a7ed19955759d240739327c77ce7bc906b77fc9560642ebd5ef5b",
      "head": "太史公曰：魏惠王之所以身不死，國不分者，二國之謀不和也。若從一家之謀，魏必分矣。故曰：「君終，無適子，其國可破",
      "editorialNotes": 0
    }
  ]
}
